@startuml
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F7F7
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #444444
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #888888
hide footbox
participant "UI" as UI
participant "Budget\nService" as S
participant "Repo\n저장소" as R
UI -> S : 2. manageBudgetPlan\n(req)
S -> R : 3. snapshot()
R --> S : 4. 상태 복사본
S -> S : 5. 월 · 예산 · 수량 검증\n초안 적용
opt 예산 / 계획 저장 요청
 S -> R : 6. saveAtomic(candidate)
 R --> S : 7. 저장 결과
 break 저장 실패
  S --> UI : SAVE_FAILED · draft
 end
end
S -> S : 8. 유효 소계 계산\n잔여 예산 계산
S --> UI : 9. 결과 Map\nsummary · items\ndraftPlan 등
@enduml
